<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="BioCultTermos — Grafo de relações semânticas">
  <title>Grafo — BioCultTermos</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css">
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/d3@7.9.0/dist/d3.min.js"
          integrity="sha384-CjloA8y00+1SDAUkjs099PVfnY2KmDC2BZnws9kh8D/lX1s46w6EPhpXdqMfjK6i"
          crossorigin="anonymous" defer></script>
  <script src="/assets/shared/graph.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-forest-50 min-h-screen flex flex-col">

  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <main class="flex-grow container mx-auto px-4 py-8">

    <div class="mb-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-forest-700">Grafo de relações semânticas</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mt-1">Hierarquia (BT/NT), associações (RT) e sinônimos entre conceitos ativos</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-6">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-4 text-center">
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-forest-700"><%= graph.counts.concepts %></div>
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Conceitos no grafo</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-4 text-center">
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-600"><%= graph.counts.broader %></div>
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Vínculos BT/NT</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-4 text-center">
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-forest-600"><%= graph.counts.related %></div>
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Vínculos RT</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-4 text-center">
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600"><%= graph.counts.synonym %></div>
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Vínculos Sinônimo</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <% if (graph.counts.concepts === 0) { %>
    <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm p-8 text-center text-gray-500">
      Nenhuma relação semântica publicada ainda.
      <p class="text-sm mt-2">
        <a href="/browse" class="text-forest-600 hover:underline">Ver a lista de termos ativos →</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <% } else { %>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="px-4 py-3 border-b border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-600">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-6 border-t-2 border-blue-400"></span> Mais amplo → Mais específico (BT/NT)</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-6 border-t-2 border-dashed border-forest-600"></span> Relacionado (RT)</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-6 border-t-2 border-dotted border-amber-600"></span> Sinônimo de (aceito)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <button id="graph-expand-all" type="button" class="px-3 py-1 rounded border border-gray-300 bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-100 text-sm">Expandir tudo</button>
          <button id="graph-collapse-all" type="button" class="px-3 py-1 rounded border border-gray-300 bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-100 text-sm">Recolher tudo</button>
          <button id="graph-zoom-out" type="button" aria-label="Diminuir zoom" class="px-3 py-1 rounded border border-gray-300 bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-100">−</button>
          <button id="graph-zoom-in" type="button" aria-label="Aumentar zoom" class="px-3 py-1 rounded border border-gray-300 bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-100">+</button>
          <button id="graph-fit" type="button" class="px-3 py-1 rounded border border-gray-300 bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-100 text-sm">Ajustar</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <% if (graph.truncated) { %>
      <p class="px-4 py-2 text-xs text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 border-b border-amber-200">
        Hierarquia muito ramificada: a árvore foi truncada. Use a
        <a href="/browse" class="underline">lista em texto</a>.
      </p>
      <% } %>
      <div id="graph-canvas" class="h-[70vh]"></div>
      <script type="application/json" id="graph-data"><%- JSON.stringify(graph).replace(/</g, '\\u003c') %></script>
      <p class="px-4 py-2 text-xs text-gray-500 border-t border-gray-200">
        Clique no ▸ para abrir os termos mais específicos e no nome do termo para abrir sua página. Arraste para mover, use a roda ou os botões para dar zoom.
        Alternativa em texto: <a href="/browse" class="text-forest-600 hover:underline">lista de termos e relações</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <% } %>

  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>
